{
  "name": "05 - Document Intake (PDF to Sheet)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 - Document intake\nEmails with PDF invoices/receipts -> each PDF is sent to your **extraction API** -> one row per document in Google Sheets -> anything uncertain pings Slack for human review.\n\n**Extraction API contract** (`POST multipart/form-data`, field `file`):\n`{ \"vendor\": \"Acme Ltd\", \"number\": \"INV-1042\", \"date\": \"2026-10-28\", \"total\": 1234.50, \"currency\": \"USD\", \"needs_review\": false }`\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Credentials: *Gmail OAuth2*, *Google Sheets OAuth2*, *Slack*, and (if your API needs a key) a *Header Auth* credential.\n2. Fill **Config**: `extractApiUrl` (the `EXTRACT_API_URL` placeholder), `sheetId`, `slackChannelId`.\n3. Sheet header row: Received, Vendor, Invoice number, Invoice date, Total, Currency, Needs review, From, Subject, File, Gmail link.\n4. Optionally narrow the Gmail filter, e.g. `has:attachment filename:pdf to:invoices@yourco.com`.\n5. Send yourself an invoice PDF, run once manually, then activate.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cde514c5-578a-52e1-b53d-72251b946eb9",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment filename:pdf",
          "readStatus": "unread"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      },
      "id": "4f5535ea-da91-55b0-877f-6dffab944521",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger (PDF attachments)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "8d897f4c-c2a1-5bed-8574-479a21001d6d",
              "name": "extractApiUrl",
              "value": "EXTRACT_API_URL",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "874d7165-5b34-513a-95ce-1d9002906163",
              "name": "sheetId",
              "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "eb728870-f4b4-5873-a60c-9769e0cba6e6",
              "name": "sheetName",
              "value": "Invoices",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "85c6e0d6-fbac-5585-929c-324369135d80",
              "name": "slackChannelId",
              "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {
          "stripBinary": false
        }
      },
      "id": "7c6db8d5-c1f9-5b26-99c6-b32719b7ce65",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        230,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "EDIT ME: every client-specific setting lives in this node. extractApiUrl must be a full URL, e.g. https://extract.yourdomain.com/extract",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = [];\nconst trigger = $('Gmail Trigger (PDF attachments)').all();\nconst inputs = $input.all();\nfor (let idx = 0; idx < inputs.length; idx++) {\n  const item = inputs[idx];\n  const j = item.json;\n  // binary survives the Config node only if \"Strip Binary Data\" is off; fall back to the trigger's copy\n  const bin = item.binary || (trigger[idx] && trigger[idx].binary) || {};\n  const addr = (j.from && j.from.value && j.from.value[0]) || {};\n  for (const key of Object.keys(bin)) {\n    const b = bin[key];\n    const isPdf = String(b.mimeType || '').toLowerCase() === 'application/pdf' || String(b.fileName || '').toLowerCase().endsWith('.pdf');\n    if (!isPdf) continue;\n    out.push({\n      json: {\n        gmailId: j.id,\n        from: addr.address || String(j.From || ''),\n        subject: j.subject || j.Subject || '',\n        fileName: b.fileName || key,\n        receivedAt: $now.toISO(),\n      },\n      binary: { data: b },\n    });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;\n"
      },
      "id": "5dd320fa-7142-5a92-a0fe-9b24d883629d",
      "name": "Split PDF Attachments",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "One output item per PDF; non-PDF attachments (images, signatures) are ignored.",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.extractApiUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "file",
              "inputDataFieldName": "data"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 90000
        }
      },
      "id": "957aca8d-6aae-52d9-a505-d0b61ce1e20b",
      "name": "Extract Document Data (API)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        690,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Extraction API key (Header Auth)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const src = $('Split PDF Attachments').item.json;\nconst r = $json || {};\nconst hasData = !r.error && (r.vendor !== undefined || r.total !== undefined || r.number !== undefined);\nconst total = Number(String(r.total === undefined || r.total === null ? '' : r.total).replace(/[^0-9.\\-]/g, ''));\nconst apiFlag = r.needs_review === true || String(r.needs_review).toLowerCase() === 'true';\nconst missing = !r.vendor || !r.number || !Number.isFinite(total) || total <= 0;\nreturn { json: {\n  ...src,\n  vendor: hasData ? String(r.vendor || '') : '',\n  number: hasData ? String(r.number || '') : '',\n  date: hasData ? String(r.date || '') : '',\n  total: Number.isFinite(total) ? total : 0,\n  currency: hasData ? String(r.currency || '') : '',\n  needsReview: !hasData || apiFlag || missing, // safety net on top of the API's own flag\n  reviewReason: !hasData ? 'extraction API failed' : apiFlag ? 'flagged by API' : missing ? 'missing vendor/number/total' : '',\n  gmailLink: 'https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#inbox/' + src.gmailId,\n} };\n",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "2e16734d-f83b-50b7-8cbd-d53e985ab15d",
      "name": "Parse Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.sheetId }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.sheetName }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Received": "={{ $json.receivedAt }}",
            "Vendor": "={{ $json.vendor }}",
            "Invoice number": "={{ $json.number }}",
            "Invoice date": "={{ $json.date }}",
            "Total": "={{ $json.total }}",
            "Currency": "={{ $json.currency }}",
            "Needs review": "={{ $json.needsReview ? 'yes' : 'no' }}",
            "From": "={{ $json.from }}",
            "Subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
            "File": "={{ $json.fileName }}",
            "Gmail link": "={{ $json.gmailLink }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "Received",
              "displayName": "Received",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Vendor",
              "displayName": "Vendor",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Invoice number",
              "displayName": "Invoice number",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Invoice date",
              "displayName": "Invoice date",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Total",
              "displayName": "Total",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Currency",
              "displayName": "Currency",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Needs review",
              "displayName": "Needs review",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "From",
              "displayName": "From",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Subject",
              "displayName": "Subject",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsed": true
            },
            {
              "id": "File",
              "displayName": "File",
              "required": false,
